1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:38,260
=Episode 5=

4
00:01:54,980 --> 00:01:56,130
Your Highness, your uncle is here.

5
00:01:56,540 --> 00:01:57,210
He's waiting in the main hall.

6
00:02:01,290 --> 00:02:02,490
I only returned yesterday.

7
00:02:03,620 --> 00:02:04,980
Word certainly travels fast to him.

8
00:02:18,130 --> 00:02:18,660
Your Highness.

9
00:02:19,820 --> 00:02:20,450
Don't make things worse.

10
00:02:28,010 --> 00:02:29,890
Just think of my niece's standing.

11
00:02:31,060 --> 00:02:32,290
You're my protege.

12
00:02:33,130 --> 00:02:34,450
If you two marry,

13
00:02:34,610 --> 00:02:36,010
we'll be family twice over.

14
00:02:37,290 --> 00:02:38,010
And then,

15
00:02:38,820 --> 00:02:40,570
once she bears you a child...

16
00:02:44,130 --> 00:02:46,010
(Princess Danyang arrives!)

17
00:02:52,260 --> 00:02:53,570
Uncle!

18
00:02:54,500 --> 00:02:56,940
I had a little too much to drink
at Cuiyun Tower last night.

19
00:02:57,450 --> 00:02:58,980
I slept in this morning.

20
00:03:00,100 --> 00:03:01,410
Sorry to keep you waiting, Uncle.

21
00:03:01,500 --> 00:03:02,290
Danyang.

22
00:03:03,290 --> 00:03:05,170
(Li Zhi, Rites Ministry's Vice Director)
You're not getting any younger.

23
00:03:10,450 --> 00:03:12,690
And who might this handsome
young gentleman be?

24
00:03:13,170 --> 00:03:14,780
What a fine-looking young man.

25
00:03:15,980 --> 00:03:17,220
You've brought him all this way, Uncle.

26
00:03:17,380 --> 00:03:18,500
Aren't you going to introduce us?

27
00:03:22,780 --> 00:03:23,890
(That old scumbag!)

28
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:26,100
(He keeps parading men through
my residence like merchandise,)

29
00:03:26,150 --> 00:03:26,890
(expecting me to choose one.)

30
00:03:27,220 --> 00:03:28,470
(Now he's even bringing me boys)

31
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,410
(this young?)

32
00:03:31,820 --> 00:03:32,690
I am Wei Shu.

33
00:03:33,260 --> 00:03:34,260
My respects, Princess Danyang.

34
00:03:34,940 --> 00:03:36,540
You're from the Wei clan of Jingzhao?

35
00:03:37,100 --> 00:03:37,730
Yes, he is.

36
00:03:39,660 --> 00:03:41,010
(Wei Shu, Member of the Wei Clan Branch)
(So this is Princess Danyang.)

37
00:03:42,170 --> 00:03:43,610
(She's remarkably uninhibited.)

38
00:03:45,570 --> 00:03:46,170
Chunhua.

39
00:03:47,820 --> 00:03:49,820
Show this young man around my study.

40
00:03:51,290 --> 00:03:52,940
I need a word with my uncle.

41
00:03:53,450 --> 00:03:53,850
Yes.

42
00:03:59,100 --> 00:03:59,690
Sir,

43
00:04:00,290 --> 00:04:00,780
this way, please.

44
00:04:11,940 --> 00:04:12,610
Uncle.

45
00:04:13,130 --> 00:04:15,570
There are quite a few members
of the Wei clan at court these days.

46
00:04:16,290 --> 00:04:17,140
I hear

47
00:04:17,540 --> 00:04:19,100
that brilliant adviser of Lord Yu's

48
00:04:19,250 --> 00:04:20,290
belongs to the Wei clan too.

49
00:04:21,850 --> 00:04:24,580
How come I've never heard

50
00:04:24,980 --> 00:04:26,220
of this young man, then?

51
00:04:26,610 --> 00:04:28,370
Wei Qiao, Lord Yu's adviser,

52
00:04:29,050 --> 00:04:30,020
is his older clansman.

53
00:04:30,900 --> 00:04:33,170
Wei Shu comes from a cadet branch
of the clan.

54
00:04:33,660 --> 00:04:34,580
But despite his lesser lineage,

55
00:04:35,220 --> 00:04:37,170
he's one of my finest students.

56
00:04:39,780 --> 00:04:42,220
Every suitor you bring me, Uncle,

57
00:04:42,930 --> 00:04:44,700
just happens to be your student.

58
00:04:45,660 --> 00:04:46,460
And now,

59
00:04:46,900 --> 00:04:48,290
you're even bringing me someone
from a cadet branch?

60
00:04:48,580 --> 00:04:49,370
What do you know?

61
00:04:49,780 --> 00:04:51,340
Sheng'an has no shortage of talent,

62
00:04:52,540 --> 00:04:56,410
but a young genius like Wei Shu
is one of a kind.

63
00:04:56,930 --> 00:04:58,050
With his abilities,

64
00:04:58,250 --> 00:05:00,140
he's certain to place
among the top three this year.

65
00:05:02,140 --> 00:05:03,170
Top three?

66
00:05:03,540 --> 00:05:04,900
He hasn't even taken the exam yet.

67
00:05:05,700 --> 00:05:06,610
Danyang,

68
00:05:07,170 --> 00:05:09,220
you must stop behaving so recklessly.

69
00:05:10,290 --> 00:05:11,290
You're a princess.

70
00:05:11,930 --> 00:05:14,100
The Mu royal family's reputation
rests on your shoulders,

71
00:05:14,700 --> 00:05:17,220
as does the honor of our Li family.

72
00:05:18,850 --> 00:05:20,490
Now that your mother is gone,

73
00:05:21,290 --> 00:05:21,850
the Li family

74
00:05:22,370 --> 00:05:23,020
has no one but me

75
00:05:23,370 --> 00:05:24,540
and you to depend on.

76
00:05:24,930 --> 00:05:26,460
If you keep standing by,

77
00:05:26,700 --> 00:05:29,250
how can you face your late mother?

78
00:05:33,410 --> 00:05:34,580
You're absolutely right, Uncle.

79
00:05:34,850 --> 00:05:36,170
You must trust me.

80
00:05:36,930 --> 00:05:38,700
Once Wei Shu passes the imperial exams

81
00:05:39,250 --> 00:05:40,100
and secures an official post,

82
00:05:40,660 --> 00:05:41,660
he'll have no connections of his own.

83
00:05:42,250 --> 00:05:43,490
He'll have to rely on the Li family.

84
00:05:44,170 --> 00:05:46,220
That'll make him easy for us to control.

85
00:05:46,610 --> 00:05:47,460
He would be

86
00:05:47,900 --> 00:05:49,700
the perfect choice for your husband.

87
00:05:52,930 --> 00:05:53,900
I understand now.

88
00:05:54,220 --> 00:05:54,730
Uncle.

89
00:05:55,250 --> 00:05:55,980
You may leave now.

90
00:05:56,930 --> 00:05:58,980
Let that young man stay at my residence.

91
00:05:59,490 --> 00:06:01,020
I'll spend some time talking to him

92
00:06:01,540 --> 00:06:02,370
and getting to know him better.

93
00:06:03,460 --> 00:06:03,930
Good.

94
00:06:04,810 --> 00:06:05,370
Excellent!

95
00:06:06,980 --> 00:06:08,900
If Wei Shu wins your favor,

96
00:06:09,490 --> 00:06:10,730
use your personal recommendation

97
00:06:10,930 --> 00:06:12,700
to get him into the Imperial Academy.

98
00:06:13,290 --> 00:06:15,050
It's worth a thousand submitted essays!

99
00:06:15,810 --> 00:06:17,410
He already comes from a noble clan.

100
00:06:18,050 --> 00:06:20,340
With honors from the exams
and a princess for a wife,

101
00:06:20,460 --> 00:06:21,460
his standing will only improve.

102
00:06:22,020 --> 00:06:23,580
He'll be a worthy match for you.

103
00:06:26,730 --> 00:06:28,580
Chunhua, tell me.

104
00:06:28,900 --> 00:06:30,850
Why is everyone so desperate
to get into the Imperial Academy?

105
00:06:31,700 --> 00:06:32,340
Who?

106
00:06:40,250 --> 00:06:42,370
(So he's a little bookworm.)

107
00:06:52,020 --> 00:06:52,410
Your Highness.

108
00:06:55,930 --> 00:06:57,250
Apart from your studies,

109
00:06:57,700 --> 00:06:58,410
what else are you good at?

110
00:07:00,460 --> 00:07:01,460
Beyond books and poetry,

111
00:07:01,810 --> 00:07:02,490
I have no other talents.

112
00:07:03,930 --> 00:07:06,170
Everyone has something they enjoy.

113
00:07:07,370 --> 00:07:08,610
I don't believe you have no hobbies.

114
00:07:09,170 --> 00:07:10,050
And if you say you don't,

115
00:07:10,290 --> 00:07:11,170
then you're lying to me.

116
00:07:13,580 --> 00:07:13,900
I...

117
00:07:14,490 --> 00:07:15,700
I enjoy studying alchemy
in my spare time.

118
00:07:17,730 --> 00:07:18,580
Then why don't you

119
00:07:18,700 --> 00:07:21,610
make me an elixir of immortality?

120
00:07:22,810 --> 00:07:24,100
Once you've made it,

121
00:07:24,490 --> 00:07:25,730
I'll reward you by making you
my husband.

122
00:07:27,250 --> 00:07:28,460
You've misunderstood, Your Highness.

123
00:07:29,170 --> 00:07:30,980
Alchemy isn't some mystical sorcery.

124
00:07:31,700 --> 00:07:32,810
It can't make people immortal.

125
00:07:33,220 --> 00:07:34,050
Really?

126
00:07:36,220 --> 00:07:36,980
Why not?

127
00:07:38,730 --> 00:07:39,140
People...

128
00:07:39,900 --> 00:07:41,410
Everyone... Everyone dies eventually.

129
00:07:42,540 --> 00:07:44,020
Don't you want to marry a princess?

130
00:07:44,810 --> 00:07:47,460
Instead of saying something sweet
to please me,

131
00:07:48,340 --> 00:07:51,050
you insist on telling me
such grim truths.

132
00:07:54,700 --> 00:07:56,780
My mentor arranged this marriage.

133
00:07:57,810 --> 00:07:58,730
It's not what I want.

134
00:07:59,540 --> 00:08:00,810
I never wanted to take this path.

135
00:08:02,140 --> 00:08:02,700
That's all I have to say.

136
00:08:03,170 --> 00:08:03,980
I accept whatever punishment
you see fit.

137
00:08:07,490 --> 00:08:08,540
Why do you keep avoiding me?

138
00:08:09,610 --> 00:08:10,730
What am I going to do, eat you alive?

139
00:08:11,980 --> 00:08:12,660
Do I look

140
00:08:12,900 --> 00:08:15,250
like some wicked woman who forces
handsome young men into her bed?

141
00:08:20,900 --> 00:08:21,810
Don't worry.

142
00:08:22,540 --> 00:08:23,660
As for my uncle's arrangements,

143
00:08:24,490 --> 00:08:25,490
I'll take care of everything.

144
00:08:26,370 --> 00:08:27,490
Go to the Imperial Academy tomorrow.

145
00:08:28,140 --> 00:08:30,140
Just say you're under my patronage,
and they'll admit you.

146
00:08:31,810 --> 00:08:34,060
As for tonight...

147
00:08:36,940 --> 00:08:39,300
Why don't you spend the night here
with me?

148
00:08:57,730 --> 00:08:58,180
Your Highness.

149
00:08:59,060 --> 00:09:00,730
Can we really trust Princess Danyang?

150
00:09:01,340 --> 00:09:03,460
Whether she truly intends
to help me or not,

151
00:09:04,010 --> 00:09:05,420
her hatred for Yu Cheng'an

152
00:09:06,420 --> 00:09:07,300
is certainly genuine.

153
00:09:07,980 --> 00:09:08,580
Back then,

154
00:09:09,610 --> 00:09:10,770
it was Yu Cheng'an

155
00:09:11,460 --> 00:09:12,610
who arranged her marriage to North Jing.

156
00:09:14,220 --> 00:09:15,030
I've heard that over the years,

157
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:16,490
she suffered terrible abuse there.

158
00:09:17,130 --> 00:09:18,580
Had Meng Baiyu not died so suddenly,

159
00:09:19,730 --> 00:09:21,610
she might have spent the rest of her
life rotting away in North Jing.

160
00:09:23,370 --> 00:09:24,770
And when she finally returned,

161
00:09:26,130 --> 00:09:27,180
the Empress had already died.

162
00:09:28,530 --> 00:09:29,250
Mother and daughter

163
00:09:30,220 --> 00:09:31,730
never even got to say goodbye.

164
00:09:33,530 --> 00:09:35,700
Once the cherished princess
and blessing of Huai Dynasty,

165
00:09:36,100 --> 00:09:37,030
she's now become

166
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:38,850
a disgraced, fallen woman.

167
00:09:40,010 --> 00:09:41,180
Her hatred for Yu Cheng'an

168
00:09:43,010 --> 00:09:44,060
must be genuine.

169
00:09:46,340 --> 00:09:47,650
I just wonder...

170
00:09:48,770 --> 00:09:49,890
After just one journey,

171
00:09:51,490 --> 00:09:52,700
where did she find the courage

172
00:09:53,730 --> 00:09:55,060
to take on such overwhelming odds?

173
00:09:55,650 --> 00:09:57,580
I've heard rumors among
the common people

174
00:09:58,820 --> 00:10:00,460
that Princess Danyang's child

175
00:10:01,010 --> 00:10:03,010
is destined to rule the realm
and establish a new dynasty.

176
00:10:03,700 --> 00:10:04,580
Utter nonsense.

177
00:10:05,580 --> 00:10:06,530
Only fools would believe that.

178
00:10:08,940 --> 00:10:09,490
Your Highness,

179
00:10:10,010 --> 00:10:11,270
Princess Danyang has invited
Li Zhi's student

180
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:12,010
to stay at her residence.

181
00:10:20,700 --> 00:10:21,770
It seems it's time

182
00:10:22,940 --> 00:10:24,890
to recall Yang Si from the army.

183
00:10:38,820 --> 00:10:39,460
(Mu Wanyao.)

184
00:10:40,580 --> 00:10:41,580
(You must gain power.)

185
00:10:42,730 --> 00:10:43,770
(You need to find allies.)

186
00:10:44,980 --> 00:10:47,060
(Only then will you stand a chance
against the "tiger".)

187
00:10:49,220 --> 00:10:50,250
(This city)

188
00:10:52,100 --> 00:10:53,060
(is your prison)

189
00:10:54,770 --> 00:10:55,770
(and your battlefield.)

190
00:10:57,890 --> 00:10:58,820
(Yet all you have around you)

191
00:10:59,530 --> 00:11:01,300
(are allies who don't trust you,)

192
00:11:02,460 --> 00:11:04,010
(a family consumed by greed,)

193
00:11:05,420 --> 00:11:07,010
(and aging, ailing loved ones.)

194
00:11:10,940 --> 00:11:11,530
(Mu Wanyao.)

195
00:11:13,130 --> 00:11:13,850
(What will you do?)

196
00:11:23,940 --> 00:11:28,340
(Mingde Gate)

197
00:11:30,980 --> 00:11:31,850
Sheng'an.

198
00:11:33,340 --> 00:11:34,180
It's been a long time.

199
00:11:40,890 --> 00:11:43,130
(This batch should fetch
a few extra coins!)

200
00:11:43,530 --> 00:11:44,250
(Such fine goods!)

201
00:11:45,980 --> 00:11:46,850
(I could charge even more!)

202
00:11:54,130 --> 00:11:55,100
(Come take a look!)

203
00:11:55,250 --> 00:11:56,010
(Greens for sale!)

204
00:11:57,730 --> 00:11:59,130
(Fresh greens!)

205
00:12:03,300 --> 00:12:04,300
(Flowers for sale!)

206
00:12:04,650 --> 00:12:05,730
(Make way! Coming through!)

207
00:12:07,650 --> 00:12:08,820
(Fresh goods!)

208
00:12:15,460 --> 00:12:16,960
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

209
00:12:16,960 --> 00:12:23,560
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

210
00:12:33,180 --> 00:12:36,180
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

211
00:12:45,800 --> 00:12:47,960
(To Princess Danyang
Respectfully, Yan Shang)

212
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:56,660
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

213
00:12:59,460 --> 00:13:03,540
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

214
00:13:04,010 --> 00:13:05,940
(Hot steamed buns!)

215
00:13:06,850 --> 00:13:09,300
(Freshly steamed buns!)

216
00:13:11,610 --> 00:13:12,220
Yan Shang?

217
00:13:15,130 --> 00:13:15,820
Wenji!

218
00:13:18,460 --> 00:13:19,890
It really is you!

219
00:13:24,700 --> 00:13:26,180
I thought my eyes were playing tricks
on me.

220
00:13:27,100 --> 00:13:28,220
What are you doing here?

221
00:13:29,650 --> 00:13:30,370
It's a long story.

222
00:13:31,100 --> 00:13:31,850
I've been traveling for two days.

223
00:13:32,580 --> 00:13:33,490
Let me get settled first.

224
00:13:35,100 --> 00:13:36,250
You've already found a place to stay?

225
00:13:36,490 --> 00:13:36,850
Where?

226
00:13:38,250 --> 00:13:39,850
There's a temple called Yongshou
up ahead.

227
00:13:40,180 --> 00:13:41,220
I'm not sure if it's still there.

228
00:13:41,650 --> 00:13:42,820
I was hoping to stay there.

229
00:13:44,890 --> 00:13:46,010
Yongshou Temple?

230
00:13:46,890 --> 00:13:47,530
Brilliant!

231
00:13:48,010 --> 00:13:48,940
That's just like you!

232
00:13:49,460 --> 00:13:50,250
Of course it's still there.

233
00:13:52,250 --> 00:13:53,220
How do you know about Yongshou Temple?

234
00:13:54,460 --> 00:13:55,340
I just asked around.

235
00:13:57,460 --> 00:13:59,300
(Cuiyun Tower)
I rented a private room at Cuiyun Tower.

236
00:13:59,530 --> 00:14:00,610
The furnishings are luxurious,

237
00:14:01,060 --> 00:14:02,220
but it's noisy all day.

238
00:14:02,490 --> 00:14:03,370
I can barely concentrate on my studies.

239
00:14:04,460 --> 00:14:05,610
It's been driving me crazy.

240
00:14:06,370 --> 00:14:07,180
But the temple is peaceful

241
00:14:07,420 --> 00:14:08,060
and has plenty of books.

242
00:14:08,890 --> 00:14:10,180
Countless scholars

243
00:14:10,370 --> 00:14:11,460
stay there to prepare for the exams.

244
00:14:12,060 --> 00:14:12,420
I'd say

245
00:14:12,770 --> 00:14:14,650
it's a hundred times better
than Cuiyun Tower!

246
00:14:15,850 --> 00:14:16,610
And here's another advantage.

247
00:14:17,580 --> 00:14:18,490
It's cheap!

248
00:14:20,490 --> 00:14:20,980
Wait here!

249
00:14:20,980 --> 00:14:22,960
(Cuiyun Tower)

250
00:14:23,730 --> 00:14:24,980
I'll go pack my things

251
00:14:25,220 --> 00:14:26,940
and move to Yongshou Temple with you!

252
00:14:28,700 --> 00:14:30,010
You'd better tell me everything

253
00:14:30,180 --> 00:14:31,700
about what happened

254
00:14:31,980 --> 00:14:33,530
(Cuiyun Tower)
and how you ended up in Sheng'an!

255
00:14:34,940 --> 00:14:35,250
All right.

256
00:14:35,940 --> 00:14:36,420
I'll wait here.

257
00:14:44,340 --> 00:14:45,220
Wei Shu.

258
00:14:46,130 --> 00:14:47,490
You're so good at studying.

259
00:14:47,820 --> 00:14:50,010
Why are you so slow
at learning backgammon?

260
00:14:50,650 --> 00:14:51,060
Your Highness,

261
00:14:51,940 --> 00:14:52,820
I've never

262
00:14:53,250 --> 00:14:54,370
played this game before.

263
00:14:54,940 --> 00:14:56,300
What a shame!

264
00:14:56,730 --> 00:14:57,610
It's so much fun.

265
00:14:58,420 --> 00:14:59,220
Let's play another round.

266
00:14:59,610 --> 00:15:00,650
You'll get the hang of it soon.

267
00:15:04,220 --> 00:15:05,300
How am I doing as your teacher?

268
00:15:09,460 --> 00:15:10,010
Your Highness,

269
00:15:10,730 --> 00:15:11,460
you're an excellent teacher.

270
00:15:13,340 --> 00:15:15,650
This is how my mother used to teach me.

271
00:15:17,060 --> 00:15:17,580
Let's continue.

272
00:15:58,630 --> 00:15:59,440
Oh, my!

273
00:16:00,820 --> 00:16:01,890
You won.

274
00:16:04,700 --> 00:16:05,340
Chunhua.

275
00:16:20,250 --> 00:16:20,700
Your Highness.

276
00:16:32,770 --> 00:16:33,850
This cloak

277
00:16:34,300 --> 00:16:35,490
is your prize for winning.

278
00:16:36,580 --> 00:16:37,250
Tomorrow,

279
00:16:38,130 --> 00:16:39,300
wear it when you go out.

280
00:16:43,490 --> 00:16:44,530
I'm tired. No more games.

281
00:17:01,060 --> 00:17:03,400
(Yongshou Temple)

282
00:17:05,010 --> 00:17:05,860
She gave me a ride.

283
00:17:06,290 --> 00:17:07,290
I got off outside the city

284
00:17:07,530 --> 00:17:08,220
and walked for another two days.

285
00:17:08,700 --> 00:17:09,380
Who would've thought

286
00:17:09,730 --> 00:17:11,180
I'd run into you as soon
as I entered the city?

287
00:17:18,620 --> 00:17:19,940
Which lucky lady is this for?

288
00:17:26,810 --> 00:17:27,660
I've been meaning to ask you.

289
00:17:28,090 --> 00:17:30,050
That guest of yours
was Princess Danyang!

290
00:17:30,530 --> 00:17:31,620
Why didn't you tell me back then?

291
00:17:34,570 --> 00:17:35,770
I was already in enough trouble.

292
00:17:36,140 --> 00:17:37,420
I couldn't drag you into it too.

293
00:17:39,050 --> 00:17:39,460
Fair enough.

294
00:17:40,180 --> 00:17:40,980
It was a serious matter.

295
00:17:41,570 --> 00:17:42,380
If I were you,

296
00:17:42,770 --> 00:17:43,810
I'd have kept my mouth shut too.

297
00:17:45,700 --> 00:17:48,490
A princess of such noble birth...

298
00:17:49,250 --> 00:17:50,660
If anything had happened to her
in the countryside,

299
00:17:51,220 --> 00:17:52,140
who could've answered for it?

300
00:17:52,900 --> 00:17:54,180
If she were truly so blessed,

301
00:17:54,700 --> 00:17:56,290
why would she have been sent
to that desolate land

302
00:17:56,770 --> 00:17:57,730
to marry a traitor?

303
00:17:59,530 --> 00:18:01,490
Well, she was born under
an auspicious omen.

304
00:18:02,090 --> 00:18:02,900
With a birth like hers,

305
00:18:04,460 --> 00:18:06,420
it's hard to say whether she's blessed
or cursed.

306
00:18:17,010 --> 00:18:17,290
Shang.

307
00:18:19,420 --> 00:18:20,980
So, Miss Chunhua...

308
00:18:22,090 --> 00:18:23,460
She really is Princess Danyang's maid?

309
00:18:23,900 --> 00:18:24,220
Yes.

310
00:18:27,010 --> 00:18:28,090
Why do you ask?

311
00:18:31,250 --> 00:18:31,530
No...

312
00:18:32,010 --> 00:18:32,460
No reason.

313
00:18:35,530 --> 00:18:36,010
Wenji.

314
00:18:36,770 --> 00:18:37,620
You're good at everything,

315
00:18:38,050 --> 00:18:38,980
except lying.

316
00:18:40,380 --> 00:18:40,700
Come on!

317
00:18:41,140 --> 00:18:42,770
There's really nothing between us!

318
00:18:43,420 --> 00:18:43,700
We...

319
00:18:43,900 --> 00:18:45,090
We barely know each other!

320
00:18:45,330 --> 00:18:47,900
Yet you can't get her off your mind.

321
00:18:51,330 --> 00:18:52,250
I'm not discussing this with you.

322
00:19:01,730 --> 00:19:02,050
Shang.

323
00:19:02,900 --> 00:19:03,460
You know,

324
00:19:03,770 --> 00:19:05,090
you really are one lucky fellow.

325
00:19:05,700 --> 00:19:07,570
You pulled off something incredible
without saying a word.

326
00:19:11,330 --> 00:19:12,180
Even my father

327
00:19:12,730 --> 00:19:14,330
couldn't get me into
the Imperial Academy.

328
00:19:15,860 --> 00:19:17,420
Yet you managed it through the princess!

329
00:19:18,010 --> 00:19:19,770
It was only a verbal promise.

330
00:19:20,330 --> 00:19:21,250
I don't even have anything in writing.

331
00:19:22,290 --> 00:19:23,250
Getting into the Imperial Academy

332
00:19:23,730 --> 00:19:24,900
may still take some effort.

333
00:19:26,140 --> 00:19:27,220
Well, you two know each other now.

334
00:19:27,900 --> 00:19:29,220
You can always ask her again

335
00:19:29,490 --> 00:19:30,490
to write you a letter of recommendation.

336
00:19:32,460 --> 00:19:34,290
At least you can visit Chunhua
at the princess's residence.

337
00:19:34,900 --> 00:19:35,900
I wouldn't dare face her.

338
00:19:37,730 --> 00:19:38,180
Why not?

339
00:19:40,980 --> 00:19:41,860
I offended her.

340
00:19:42,620 --> 00:19:44,770
If I showed up, she'd probably
beat me up.

341
00:19:55,530 --> 00:19:57,380
Young men, one after another...

342
00:19:59,180 --> 00:19:59,980
What are you muttering about?

343
00:20:00,900 --> 00:20:02,330
You've turned away every man

344
00:20:02,490 --> 00:20:03,770
your uncle has brought here.

345
00:20:04,380 --> 00:20:05,660
Why keep this one?

346
00:20:07,290 --> 00:20:09,330
Have you actually taken a liking to him?

347
00:20:11,330 --> 00:20:12,220
I have taken a liking to him.

348
00:20:17,140 --> 00:20:18,290
What about Yan Shang, then?

349
00:20:18,810 --> 00:20:19,660
Why would I want him?

350
00:20:22,570 --> 00:20:23,250
In the past,

351
00:20:24,050 --> 00:20:25,220
all the men my uncle brought here

352
00:20:26,090 --> 00:20:27,330
were nothing but scheming opportunists.

353
00:20:28,420 --> 00:20:29,290
But Wei Shu

354
00:20:30,140 --> 00:20:30,810
is different.

355
00:20:32,290 --> 00:20:33,050
I'm keeping him around.

356
00:20:33,250 --> 00:20:34,250
He'll prove useful someday.

357
00:20:37,730 --> 00:20:39,140
If the gossips in the capital find out,

358
00:20:39,290 --> 00:20:40,180
they'll never stop talking.

359
00:20:41,980 --> 00:20:43,490
Do you think I'm afraid of gossip?

360
00:20:44,530 --> 00:20:45,660
Surely you don't think

361
00:20:46,010 --> 00:20:47,860
I have a good reputation to protect?

362
00:20:48,730 --> 00:20:49,290
But...

363
00:20:49,810 --> 00:20:50,940
No more buts, Chunhua.

364
00:20:52,140 --> 00:20:53,010
From now on,

365
00:20:53,420 --> 00:20:54,330
everything will be different.

366
00:20:56,010 --> 00:20:56,980
This residence

367
00:20:57,700 --> 00:20:58,700
will soon be filled with more
and more people.

368
00:21:09,860 --> 00:21:10,980
This fine wine from the Western Regions

369
00:21:11,770 --> 00:21:14,220
somehow doesn't taste as good
as that cheap wine from Lingnan.

370
00:21:14,770 --> 00:21:15,140
Your Highness,

371
00:21:15,530 --> 00:21:17,770
shall I send someone to Lingnan
to buy more?

372
00:21:18,420 --> 00:21:18,980
No need.

373
00:21:19,810 --> 00:21:20,900
Perhaps it's just my imagination.

374
00:21:22,250 --> 00:21:22,940
Once I taste it again,

375
00:21:24,330 --> 00:21:25,380
I might find it's nothing special.

376
00:21:27,730 --> 00:21:28,290
Oh, Your Highness,

377
00:21:29,220 --> 00:21:30,250
Yan Shang has written you a letter.

378
00:21:30,570 --> 00:21:31,530
(To Princess Danyang; Yan Shang)
The gatekeeper received it today.

379
00:21:33,860 --> 00:21:34,700
I don't have time to read it.

380
00:21:35,530 --> 00:21:37,730
And stop accepting every little thing
sent to my residence.

381
00:21:58,220 --> 00:22:00,620
Shang, don't underestimate

382
00:22:00,810 --> 00:22:01,860
the imperial exams.

383
00:22:02,050 --> 00:22:03,940
It takes more than studying
and intelligence.

384
00:22:05,660 --> 00:22:06,460
These past few days,

385
00:22:07,050 --> 00:22:08,090
I've come to realize something.

386
00:22:09,980 --> 00:22:11,140
Sheng'an is full

387
00:22:11,250 --> 00:22:12,380
of brilliant scholars

388
00:22:12,730 --> 00:22:13,570
and powerful nobles.

389
00:22:14,380 --> 00:22:16,290
All those scholars hoping
to enter officialdom

390
00:22:16,660 --> 00:22:18,250
spend day and night seeking patronage.

391
00:22:19,420 --> 00:22:22,050
They compile and copy their poems
and essays,

392
00:22:22,490 --> 00:22:24,980
then submit them to influential families
to gain favor.

393
00:22:26,220 --> 00:22:26,660
As the saying goes,

394
00:22:27,290 --> 00:22:28,940
"By morning, feast with the mighty.

395
00:22:29,530 --> 00:22:31,570
By dusk, wander the dusty streets."

396
00:22:33,460 --> 00:22:34,980
If you manage to impress
a powerful patron,

397
00:22:36,050 --> 00:22:38,530
your chances in the exams
improve enormously.

398
00:22:40,620 --> 00:22:41,290
You see,

399
00:22:42,330 --> 00:22:43,250
the higher your social standing,

400
00:22:43,860 --> 00:22:45,490
the better your chances of passing.

401
00:22:47,090 --> 00:22:49,220
The most powerful man in Sheng'an

402
00:22:49,940 --> 00:22:51,570
must be Lord Yu, Yu Cheng'an, right?

403
00:22:53,090 --> 00:22:53,460
Exactly.

404
00:22:55,010 --> 00:22:55,700
All these years,

405
00:22:56,180 --> 00:22:58,700
those imperial court reports
I showed you weren't wasted!

406
00:23:00,900 --> 00:23:02,860
The Rebellion of the Seven Garrisons
was crushed

407
00:23:03,250 --> 00:23:04,380
by the Shence Army.

408
00:23:04,810 --> 00:23:05,530
And that army

409
00:23:05,980 --> 00:23:07,330
was commanded by Yu Cheng'an himself.

410
00:23:08,010 --> 00:23:09,620
After the rebellion was suppressed,

411
00:23:09,940 --> 00:23:11,980
Yu Cheng'an retained command
of a vast army

412
00:23:13,250 --> 00:23:15,420
and was named General of Cavalry
and Duke of Zhao.

413
00:23:15,900 --> 00:23:17,860
He can even enter court armed,
wielding unrivaled power.

414
00:23:22,860 --> 00:23:23,730
In private,

415
00:23:24,250 --> 00:23:25,530
people call him the emperor
behind the throne.

416
00:23:26,770 --> 00:23:28,380
Even the man on the throne

417
00:23:29,770 --> 00:23:30,700
probably has to yield to him.

418
00:23:35,570 --> 00:23:37,220
If he's really that powerful,

419
00:23:38,180 --> 00:23:39,700
then seeking his patronage
would be hopeless.

420
00:23:40,620 --> 00:23:41,460
Never mind ordinary scholars.

421
00:23:41,980 --> 00:23:43,380
Even officials in Sheng'an

422
00:23:43,770 --> 00:23:44,810
who serve at the same court

423
00:23:45,730 --> 00:23:47,620
must find him utterly
beyond their reach.

424
00:23:51,530 --> 00:23:52,140
You're right.

425
00:23:56,660 --> 00:23:57,620
So, Wenji,

426
00:23:58,460 --> 00:23:59,460
whose patronage will you seek?

427
00:24:00,770 --> 00:24:02,140
I'm a man of honor!

428
00:24:02,380 --> 00:24:04,490
Flattering and groveling
before the powerful?

429
00:24:04,660 --> 00:24:05,730
I'd never stoop so low!

430
00:24:06,900 --> 00:24:09,220
Let alone associate with those eunuchs!

431
00:24:20,980 --> 00:24:21,330
Shang.

432
00:24:24,730 --> 00:24:25,050
I...

433
00:24:26,250 --> 00:24:27,980
I wasn't accusing you of using
Princess Danyang to get ahead.

434
00:24:32,420 --> 00:24:33,140
We're friends.

435
00:24:33,900 --> 00:24:34,570
There's no need to explain.

436
00:24:38,380 --> 00:24:39,010
All right, Shang.

437
00:24:39,570 --> 00:24:41,090
You've spent all day unpacking.

438
00:24:41,290 --> 00:24:41,860
Get some rest.

439
00:24:43,250 --> 00:24:44,660
I've been hauling luggage
all day myself.

440
00:24:44,810 --> 00:24:45,490
I'm exhausted.

441
00:24:51,380 --> 00:24:52,090
(But Wenji,)

442
00:24:53,290 --> 00:24:55,900
(Lord Yu now controls
the entire imperial court.)

443
00:24:56,940 --> 00:24:58,010
(If you want to enter officialdom,)

444
00:24:59,140 --> 00:25:01,140
(how can you possibly
keep your hands clean?)

445
00:25:25,500 --> 00:25:28,640
(Imperial Academy)

446
00:25:28,700 --> 00:25:29,250
(Take care!)

447
00:25:36,770 --> 00:25:37,110
(Thank you.)

448
00:25:37,160 --> 00:25:37,940
(Mr. Wang! Come here!)

449
00:25:38,530 --> 00:25:39,290
(Let's go!)

450
00:25:39,980 --> 00:25:40,350
(Morning, Mr. Li!)

451
00:25:40,400 --> 00:25:41,010
(Come on, let's go together.)

452
00:25:41,180 --> 00:25:41,430
(Let's go.)

453
00:25:41,480 --> 00:25:41,720
(Sure.)

454
00:25:41,770 --> 00:25:42,860
(Fresh greens!)

455
00:25:43,700 --> 00:25:44,290
(Come again!)

456
00:25:44,290 --> 00:25:45,420
(Gathering Auspice)

457
00:25:45,420 --> 00:25:45,860
Stop right there!

458
00:25:47,090 --> 00:25:48,090
Who are you?

459
00:25:48,810 --> 00:25:50,940
Why haven't I seen you
at the Imperial Academy before?

460
00:25:54,140 --> 00:25:54,490
Sir.

461
00:25:55,940 --> 00:25:57,700
Princess Danyang recommended me
for admission.

462
00:25:58,250 --> 00:25:58,730
Young man,

463
00:25:59,330 --> 00:26:00,940
do you have proof of your rank
and family background?

464
00:26:01,490 --> 00:26:02,730
And your registration papers?

465
00:26:03,530 --> 00:26:04,010
No.

466
00:26:04,660 --> 00:26:06,050
Princess Danyang has vouched for me.

467
00:26:07,140 --> 00:26:07,940
If you don't believe me,

468
00:26:08,490 --> 00:26:09,620
you may verify it at her residence.

469
00:26:10,660 --> 00:26:12,090
The princess's residence
sent word yesterday

470
00:26:12,250 --> 00:26:14,530
that she'd recommend a young man
from a noble family.

471
00:26:15,250 --> 00:26:16,980
This must be him.

472
00:26:17,380 --> 00:26:18,250
(A young man from a noble family?)

473
00:26:20,050 --> 00:26:20,860
A misunderstanding!

474
00:26:21,090 --> 00:26:21,670
(Imperial Academy; Gathering Auspice)
Just a misunderstanding.

475
00:26:21,720 --> 00:26:22,380
Please follow me.

476
00:26:27,330 --> 00:26:27,770
Stop!

477
00:26:29,570 --> 00:26:32,010
I don't believe I've seen you before,
young man.

478
00:26:32,420 --> 00:26:34,350
What brings you here?

479
00:26:34,400 --> 00:26:34,770
I...

480
00:26:35,620 --> 00:26:36,900
I'm here to enroll
at the Imperial Academy.

481
00:26:38,010 --> 00:26:38,700
Enroll?

482
00:26:40,090 --> 00:26:41,330
(That's Mu Wanyao's cloak.)

483
00:26:42,420 --> 00:26:43,050
(Then he must be)

484
00:26:43,900 --> 00:26:44,670
(the young nobleman)

485
00:26:44,720 --> 00:26:46,860
(who's truly won the princess's favor.)

486
00:26:47,290 --> 00:26:48,330
Who recommended you?

487
00:26:48,730 --> 00:26:49,530
Do you have proof?

488
00:26:51,620 --> 00:26:52,460
I... Princess...

489
00:26:53,940 --> 00:26:54,220
Her...

490
00:26:57,380 --> 00:26:59,250
Who exactly recommended you?

491
00:26:59,620 --> 00:27:01,110
Why is it so hard to say?

492
00:27:01,160 --> 00:27:01,460
I...

493
00:27:07,220 --> 00:27:07,570
Sir.

494
00:27:08,490 --> 00:27:09,940
This young gentleman, like me,

495
00:27:10,530 --> 00:27:11,810
was also recommended
by Princess Danyang.

496
00:27:13,810 --> 00:27:15,660
Her residence never mentioned
two people.

497
00:27:16,050 --> 00:27:17,250
Why would there be two?

498
00:27:20,050 --> 00:27:22,010
Because Her Highness is generous
with her affections.

499
00:27:22,290 --> 00:27:23,770
If you find that scandalous,

500
00:27:24,380 --> 00:27:25,770
you're welcome to take it up with her.

501
00:27:26,620 --> 00:27:26,940
Well...

502
00:27:32,770 --> 00:27:35,330
(Imperial Academy; Gathering Auspice)
Follow me to complete your enrollment.

503
00:27:38,010 --> 00:27:38,730
(Wang! Over here!)

504
00:27:39,010 --> 00:27:39,380
(Over here!)

505
00:27:39,570 --> 00:27:40,570
(Mr. Li! Stop him!)

506
00:27:41,220 --> 00:27:41,500
(This way!)

507
00:27:41,550 --> 00:27:42,140
About earlier...

508
00:27:42,900 --> 00:27:43,460
Thank you.

509
00:27:44,380 --> 00:27:44,810
You're welcome.

510
00:27:45,490 --> 00:27:46,490
Actually, I should be thanking you.

511
00:27:47,250 --> 00:27:47,900
To tell you the truth,

512
00:27:48,570 --> 00:27:50,290
without using your connection
to the princess,

513
00:27:51,050 --> 00:27:52,250
I'd never have gotten
into the Imperial Academy.

514
00:27:55,620 --> 00:27:56,290
Wei Shu, wait!

515
00:28:02,380 --> 00:28:02,810
Yan Shang.

516
00:28:03,620 --> 00:28:04,660
Though I belong to the Wei clan,

517
00:28:05,380 --> 00:28:06,530
I'm only a concubine's son
from a lesser branch.

518
00:28:07,620 --> 00:28:08,570
But I'm not the princess's...

519
00:28:10,220 --> 00:28:10,730
Her...

520
00:28:13,010 --> 00:28:13,660
Male favorite?

521
00:28:14,940 --> 00:28:15,460
I'm not!

522
00:28:17,980 --> 00:28:18,620
Neither are you?

523
00:28:20,050 --> 00:28:20,530
Neither?

524
00:28:23,660 --> 00:28:24,180
Anyway,

525
00:28:24,980 --> 00:28:26,140
even if you befriend me,

526
00:28:26,570 --> 00:28:27,570
I can't do much for you.

527
00:28:30,570 --> 00:28:31,010
Wei Shu,

528
00:28:33,860 --> 00:28:34,330
you're overthinking it.

529
00:28:35,660 --> 00:28:36,770
I'm from Lingnan.

530
00:28:37,330 --> 00:28:38,420
My family makes a living farming.

531
00:28:39,380 --> 00:28:40,180
Would you be willing

532
00:28:40,700 --> 00:28:42,490
to be friends with a humble country boy
like me?

533
00:28:48,250 --> 00:28:48,730
Yan Shang.

534
00:28:49,700 --> 00:28:50,460
I'm ashamed of myself.

535
00:28:51,250 --> 00:28:52,620
I judged you by my own petty standards.

536
00:28:58,980 --> 00:28:59,380
Come on.

537
00:29:00,090 --> 00:29:00,860
Let's look around outside.

538
00:29:01,900 --> 00:29:02,700
I'm new to Sheng'an,

539
00:29:03,090 --> 00:29:03,860
so I'll need you, Wei Shu,

540
00:29:04,460 --> 00:29:05,490
to show me around.

541
00:29:06,420 --> 00:29:06,810
Of course.

542
00:29:07,380 --> 00:29:07,700
Sure.

543
00:29:08,460 --> 00:29:08,730
Let's go.

544
00:29:12,250 --> 00:29:13,630
(Stop teasing us! Come on!)

545
00:29:13,680 --> 00:29:14,430
(Just show us already!)

546
00:29:14,480 --> 00:29:15,250
- Gentlemen!
- (Let us see!)

547
00:29:15,380 --> 00:29:16,530
- Please, be patient.
- (What's so special about it?)

548
00:29:16,980 --> 00:29:18,490
Today, I spent a fortune

549
00:29:19,180 --> 00:29:20,460
to acquire this inkstone.

550
00:29:21,140 --> 00:29:21,540
Let us see it.

551
00:29:21,590 --> 00:29:22,770
I'm afraid I can't show it to you.

552
00:29:23,380 --> 00:29:24,490
This inkstone is priceless.

553
00:29:24,700 --> 00:29:25,570
It can't be shown to just anyone.

554
00:29:25,980 --> 00:29:26,900
At noon today,

555
00:29:27,290 --> 00:29:28,620
at Cuiyun Tower in Pingkang Ward,

556
00:29:29,250 --> 00:29:30,940
I'll unveil the inkstone for all to see.

557
00:29:31,330 --> 00:29:32,010
I invite you all

558
00:29:32,620 --> 00:29:33,460
to feast your eyes on it!

559
00:29:34,620 --> 00:29:35,460
(Tea Aromas Abound; Wenyan Studio)
(All right! All right!)

560
00:29:35,510 --> 00:29:35,950
(I'll definitely be there!)

561
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:36,460
(It's a deal!)

562
00:29:36,510 --> 00:29:38,330
We'll certainly come and see it!

563
00:29:39,380 --> 00:29:41,290
(I don't believe it.
What's so special about an inkstone?)

564
00:29:43,180 --> 00:29:43,460
(Right!)

565
00:29:43,860 --> 00:29:44,910
(Let's see if this treasure
is the real deal!)

566
00:29:44,960 --> 00:29:45,460
Yan Shang.

567
00:29:46,250 --> 00:29:47,570
Cuiyun Tower in Pingkang Ward

568
00:29:47,900 --> 00:29:49,290
(Tea Aromas Abound; Wenyan Studio)
is where the capital's rich

569
00:29:49,460 --> 00:29:50,570
and powerful gather
to spend money like water.

570
00:29:53,140 --> 00:29:54,940
Cuiyun Tower in Pingkang Ward...

571
00:29:56,140 --> 00:29:56,490
Wei Shu,

572
00:29:57,140 --> 00:29:58,570
let's go see this treasure
for ourselves.

573
00:29:59,530 --> 00:30:00,220
I think I'll...

574
00:30:00,980 --> 00:30:01,460
pass.

575
00:30:01,530 --> 00:30:02,590
(Unveil it! Unveil it!)

576
00:30:02,640 --> 00:30:03,020
Excuse me.

577
00:30:03,070 --> 00:30:09,070
(Unveil it! Unveil it! Unveil it!)

578
00:30:09,070 --> 00:30:15,880
(Unveil it! Unveil it! Unveil it!)

579
00:30:22,660 --> 00:30:23,900
(There's nothing special about it.)

580
00:30:24,980 --> 00:30:25,670
(That's supposed to be a treasure?)

581
00:30:25,720 --> 00:30:26,630
(Feng Xianyu, Imperial Exam Candidate)
My name is Feng Xianyu.

582
00:30:26,680 --> 00:30:27,380
(Did we get tricked?)

583
00:30:28,250 --> 00:30:29,570
I've studied tirelessly for ten years,

584
00:30:30,180 --> 00:30:31,140
devouring countless books.

585
00:30:31,530 --> 00:30:33,810
Yet I've had no chance
to fulfill my ambitions.

586
00:30:35,140 --> 00:30:36,570
Just like this inkstone,

587
00:30:37,250 --> 00:30:38,140
I'm buried in obscurity,

588
00:30:38,730 --> 00:30:39,460
unnoticed by anyone.

589
00:30:43,050 --> 00:30:44,630
(That cost a thousand qian!)

590
00:30:44,680 --> 00:30:45,330
(And he just smashed it!)

591
00:30:45,660 --> 00:30:46,570
A mere stone.

592
00:30:47,380 --> 00:30:49,010
All it takes is some empty praise

593
00:30:49,570 --> 00:30:51,010
to draw crowds from across the city.

594
00:30:51,620 --> 00:30:52,460
Yet I, Feng Xianyu,

595
00:30:53,700 --> 00:30:55,090
am worth less than a worthless rock!

596
00:31:01,420 --> 00:31:01,940
Excuse me.

597
00:31:04,140 --> 00:31:05,770
Feng Xianyu, did you invite us here

598
00:31:06,460 --> 00:31:08,530
just to watch you smash an inkstone?

599
00:31:09,290 --> 00:31:09,620
No.

600
00:31:10,530 --> 00:31:12,290
I wanted everyone to read my writing.

601
00:31:13,860 --> 00:31:15,090
This so-called treasure may be a fake,

602
00:31:16,050 --> 00:31:17,460
but my gift for poetry

603
00:31:18,290 --> 00:31:19,140
is the real thing!

604
00:31:22,020 --> 00:31:25,260
(My blade untested, spirit sheathed,
it hums with the river's endless roar.)

605
00:31:31,860 --> 00:31:34,700
How many autumns have I spent a stranger
in Sheng'an?

606
00:31:37,420 --> 00:31:40,490
In autumn winds, I ride alone
and climb the tower.

607
00:31:41,460 --> 00:31:44,050
My sword remains untested,
its spirit sheathed,

608
00:31:48,530 --> 00:31:52,330
yet flows with the river's roar,
day and night.

609
00:31:59,460 --> 00:32:00,170
What a wonderful poem!

610
00:32:00,220 --> 00:32:00,730
(Brilliant poetry!)

611
00:32:01,090 --> 00:32:01,700
(Beautifully written!)

612
00:32:01,750 --> 00:32:02,540
- Excellent poem!
- (Wonderful!)

613
00:32:02,590 --> 00:32:03,620
(Especially that line!)

614
00:32:04,180 --> 00:32:04,660
(Bravo!)

615
00:32:04,860 --> 00:32:05,330
(Marvelous!)

616
00:32:06,490 --> 00:32:07,420
(Outstanding!)

617
00:32:08,240 --> 00:32:11,620
(My blade untested, spirit sheathed,
it hums with the river's endless roar.)

618
00:32:13,010 --> 00:32:13,900
(What a brilliant poem!)

619
00:32:14,180 --> 00:32:15,150
(Yes! That's him!)

620
00:32:15,200 --> 00:32:16,110
- (What a remarkable young talent!)
- (Magnificent!)

621
00:32:16,160 --> 00:32:16,980
- (Give me a copy too!)
- (Such talent at his age!)

622
00:32:17,030 --> 00:32:18,330
(What extraordinary spirit!)

623
00:32:18,620 --> 00:32:19,150
(Excellent writing!)

624
00:32:19,200 --> 00:32:19,690
(Brilliant poem!)

625
00:32:19,730 --> 00:32:20,190
(Beautifully written!)

626
00:32:20,240 --> 00:32:20,590
(Wonderful!)

627
00:32:20,640 --> 00:32:21,780
(Marvelous! Simply marvelous!)

628
00:32:21,830 --> 00:32:22,860
(What excellent writing!)

629
00:32:24,140 --> 00:32:24,460
Wei Shu.

630
00:32:25,330 --> 00:32:27,330
You don't seem to approve of his stunt.

631
00:32:29,290 --> 00:32:30,180
It's all a cheap trick.

632
00:32:30,490 --> 00:32:31,420
No gentleman would stoop to that.

633
00:32:33,460 --> 00:32:33,810
Yan Shang,

634
00:32:34,570 --> 00:32:35,050
let's go.

635
00:32:36,090 --> 00:32:36,420
All right.

636
00:32:40,180 --> 00:32:40,860
Sir, wait!

637
00:32:43,980 --> 00:32:45,010
Thank you for recognizing my talent

638
00:32:45,140 --> 00:32:46,090
and speaking up for me today.

639
00:32:46,490 --> 00:32:47,620
May I ask your name?

640
00:32:48,460 --> 00:32:49,010
My surname is Yan.

641
00:32:49,380 --> 00:32:49,770
I'm Yan Shang.

642
00:32:50,380 --> 00:32:50,730
Yan Shang,

643
00:32:51,090 --> 00:32:52,530
without your support today,

644
00:32:52,980 --> 00:32:54,730
I'd have been talking to myself!

645
00:32:55,420 --> 00:32:56,250
You have a gift for poetry.

646
00:32:56,730 --> 00:32:57,940
Whether I'd spoken up or not,

647
00:32:58,330 --> 00:32:59,180
someone would eventually
recognize your talent.

648
00:33:00,730 --> 00:33:02,180
I'm afraid by the time
someone recognizes it,

649
00:33:02,290 --> 00:33:03,330
I'll already be a dead man.

650
00:33:03,940 --> 00:33:04,770
But in any case,

651
00:33:05,220 --> 00:33:05,660
today,

652
00:33:06,220 --> 00:33:07,570
I insist on treating you
to a proper drink.

653
00:33:11,050 --> 00:33:13,140
Well, how could I refuse?

654
00:33:14,250 --> 00:33:14,700
Yan Shang.

655
00:33:15,290 --> 00:33:16,730
Sir, why don't you join us?

656
00:33:17,770 --> 00:33:18,140
No, thanks.

657
00:33:18,940 --> 00:33:19,420
Let's go.

658
00:33:19,770 --> 00:33:20,900
Go. Go.

659
00:33:24,460 --> 00:33:26,660
What an incredible coincidence!

660
00:33:27,860 --> 00:33:29,050
I study at the Imperial Academy too.

661
00:33:29,460 --> 00:33:31,490
But in all my time attending classes,

662
00:33:31,620 --> 00:33:33,050
I don't recall seeing either of you.

663
00:33:33,490 --> 00:33:34,900
We only enrolled today.

664
00:33:35,380 --> 00:33:36,290
That makes it even more remarkable!

665
00:33:36,900 --> 00:33:38,530
Had we met a day earlier,
we wouldn't even be classmates!

666
00:33:39,090 --> 00:33:39,980
What a stroke of fate!

667
00:33:40,250 --> 00:33:41,140
That calls for a toast!

668
00:33:50,940 --> 00:33:53,090
Feng Xianyu, when did you enroll
at the Imperial Academy?

669
00:33:53,900 --> 00:33:54,700
I'm ashamed to say,

670
00:33:55,380 --> 00:33:57,220
I've been studying there for five years

671
00:33:57,770 --> 00:33:58,860
and failed the exams every year.

672
00:33:59,980 --> 00:34:01,090
Otherwise,

673
00:34:01,380 --> 00:34:03,090
why would I resort to
such a publicity stunt?

674
00:34:06,050 --> 00:34:08,050
(Mu Wanyao was right.)

675
00:34:09,570 --> 00:34:11,650
(Sheng'an truly is full
of talented people.)

676
00:34:13,210 --> 00:34:14,430
(With such literary talent)

677
00:34:14,480 --> 00:34:15,860
(and such a flair for scheming,)

678
00:34:16,780 --> 00:34:18,820
(there's probably nothing
this man wouldn't do.)

679
00:34:19,010 --> 00:34:19,380
Have some food.

680
00:34:20,720 --> 00:34:26,340
(My blade untested, spirit sheathed,
it hums with the river's endless roar.)

681
00:34:26,340 --> 00:34:31,960
(My blade untested, spirit sheathed,
it hums with the river's endless roar.)

682
00:34:32,260 --> 00:34:35,260
(Xu Mianmian, Singer at Cuiyun Tower)

683
00:34:35,360 --> 00:34:39,440
(My blade untested, spirit sheathed,
it hums with the river's endless roar.)

684
00:34:40,650 --> 00:34:41,260
Come on!

685
00:34:43,740 --> 00:34:44,820
- Come here, Mianmian!
- Sir!

686
00:34:45,380 --> 00:34:45,980
(Please! Stop!)

687
00:34:46,030 --> 00:34:46,780
(What are you doing?)

688
00:34:47,050 --> 00:34:48,650
- (Let go!)
- (You're so beautiful!)

689
00:34:48,860 --> 00:34:50,460
(Sir, let go of me!)

690
00:34:50,650 --> 00:34:50,910
(Come here!)

691
00:34:50,960 --> 00:34:51,610
(This is outrageous!)

692
00:34:51,690 --> 00:34:52,300
(Sir!)

693
00:34:52,650 --> 00:34:53,270
(Don't be scared.)

694
00:34:53,320 --> 00:34:54,100
(Sir, please don't!)

695
00:34:54,150 --> 00:34:55,300
(Let me take you out for some fun!)

696
00:34:55,650 --> 00:34:56,650
(Sir, stop it!)

697
00:34:57,610 --> 00:34:58,260
(I don't want to!)

698
00:34:58,940 --> 00:34:59,580
(Sir!)

699
00:34:59,630 --> 00:35:00,100
(Don't run away!)

700
00:35:00,150 --> 00:35:01,060
(Sir, this isn't right!)

701
00:35:01,110 --> 00:35:02,210
- (Please let me go!)
- (Don't run!)

702
00:35:02,300 --> 00:35:02,780
(Come with me!)

703
00:35:02,860 --> 00:35:03,210
Yan Shang.

704
00:35:04,010 --> 00:35:04,780
Don't try to play the hero.

705
00:35:06,530 --> 00:35:07,690
That man's name is Zhang Renjing.

706
00:35:08,170 --> 00:35:10,340
He's an illiterate thug
from the Shence Army.

707
00:35:11,050 --> 00:35:12,010
He's killed countless people.

708
00:35:12,090 --> 00:35:12,460
Get lost!

709
00:35:12,530 --> 00:35:14,090
He earned an officer's rank
through his military exploits

710
00:35:14,610 --> 00:35:15,820
and was recently transferred
to Sheng'an.

711
00:35:16,260 --> 00:35:17,350
He's one of Lord Yu's favorites.

712
00:35:17,400 --> 00:35:18,140
(Please, sir! Let me go!)

713
00:35:18,190 --> 00:35:19,490
Everyone in the capital steers clear
of him.

714
00:35:19,570 --> 00:35:20,100
(I'm begging you!)

715
00:35:20,150 --> 00:35:20,570
(Come on!)

716
00:35:21,530 --> 00:35:22,050
Zhang...

717
00:35:23,940 --> 00:35:24,490
Ren...

718
00:35:26,340 --> 00:35:26,780
jing...

719
00:35:31,740 --> 00:35:32,740
How do you write his name?

720
00:35:32,940 --> 00:35:33,780
Ren, meaning "person."

721
00:35:34,650 --> 00:35:35,300
Jing, meaning "to quell rebellion."

722
00:35:41,860 --> 00:35:42,650
You've misunderstood, Feng Xianyu.

723
00:35:44,170 --> 00:35:45,610
I merely want to catch up

724
00:35:47,010 --> 00:35:47,820
with Captain Zhang.

725
00:35:49,940 --> 00:35:50,380
Yan Shang!

726
00:35:58,650 --> 00:35:59,130
Captain.

727
00:35:59,860 --> 00:36:00,570
It's been a long time.

728
00:36:01,010 --> 00:36:02,010
And you are...?

729
00:36:03,860 --> 00:36:05,170
You must meet so many people, Captain.

730
00:36:05,780 --> 00:36:06,420
Don't you remember me?

731
00:36:12,690 --> 00:36:14,300
You're that...

732
00:36:17,460 --> 00:36:18,460
My surname is Yan.

733
00:36:18,940 --> 00:36:19,650
I'm from Lingnan.

734
00:36:24,460 --> 00:36:24,980
Shang.

735
00:36:27,210 --> 00:36:27,820
Shang.

736
00:36:29,610 --> 00:36:30,690
What position do you hold?

737
00:36:30,860 --> 00:36:31,570
I am

738
00:36:32,260 --> 00:36:33,050
just a commoner.

739
00:36:33,460 --> 00:36:34,420
I hold no official rank or degree.

740
00:36:35,170 --> 00:36:36,710
Then why the hell are you

741
00:36:36,760 --> 00:36:37,740
acting all friendly with me?

742
00:36:38,460 --> 00:36:38,780
Get lost!

743
00:36:40,650 --> 00:36:41,010
Where is she?

744
00:36:42,340 --> 00:36:42,900
Where is she?

745
00:36:44,490 --> 00:36:44,900
Where is she?

746
00:36:45,130 --> 00:36:46,290
(Let's go! Hurry!)

747
00:36:46,340 --> 00:36:47,090
(Quick! Get out of here!)

748
00:36:47,210 --> 00:36:47,820
(Go! Go!)

749
00:36:50,170 --> 00:36:50,780
Where did she run off to?

750
00:36:51,980 --> 00:36:52,340
Yan Shang.

751
00:36:53,170 --> 00:36:53,740
Are you all right?

752
00:36:55,300 --> 00:36:55,610
I'm fine.

753
00:36:55,820 --> 00:36:56,170
Yan Shang.

754
00:36:57,050 --> 00:36:58,130
That man is an uncouth brute.

755
00:36:58,820 --> 00:36:59,860
Don't stoop to his level.

756
00:37:00,900 --> 00:37:01,460
But...

757
00:37:02,420 --> 00:37:03,420
how do you know him?

758
00:37:07,490 --> 00:37:08,650
I've known him for many years.

759
00:37:09,570 --> 00:37:10,300
He's just forgotten.

760
00:37:13,340 --> 00:37:14,860
We've heard poetry and enjoyed our wine.

761
00:37:15,170 --> 00:37:16,090
We've had our fun. Time to go.

762
00:37:16,610 --> 00:37:16,940
Let's go.

763
00:37:18,570 --> 00:37:18,900
Let's go.

764
00:37:21,570 --> 00:37:23,020
(Cuiyun Tower)
(Come take a look!)

765
00:37:23,070 --> 00:37:24,860
(Hot steamed buns!)

766
00:37:25,650 --> 00:37:28,170
(Freshly steamed buns!)

767
00:37:29,460 --> 00:37:30,650
(Come try some!)

768
00:37:32,340 --> 00:37:33,570
You're blocking the road!

769
00:37:33,940 --> 00:37:34,300
(Hurry up!)

770
00:37:34,460 --> 00:37:34,950
Can't you see the carriage?

771
00:37:35,000 --> 00:37:35,490
(Get moving!)

772
00:37:35,690 --> 00:37:36,300
- (Move aside!)
- (I'm talking to you!)

773
00:37:36,690 --> 00:37:37,370
(What are you staring at?)

774
00:37:37,420 --> 00:37:37,820
(Move!)

775
00:37:38,570 --> 00:37:40,490
So that's Grand Princess
Luling's carriage.

776
00:37:40,940 --> 00:37:41,570
No wonder.

777
00:37:42,420 --> 00:37:44,940
Do all the princesses in our dynasty
make such a grand entrance?

778
00:37:46,460 --> 00:37:48,260
Not all princesses are alike.

779
00:37:49,010 --> 00:37:49,940
I've heard of her.

780
00:37:50,210 --> 00:37:50,940
She's a Taoist priestess.

781
00:37:51,610 --> 00:37:52,490
She's supposed to have renounced
worldly pursuits.

782
00:37:52,860 --> 00:37:53,820
Why would she be so arrogant?

783
00:37:54,380 --> 00:37:56,170
Wei Shu, there's something
you don't know.

784
00:37:56,570 --> 00:37:59,130
Grand Princess Luling is notoriously
lustful and cruel.

785
00:37:59,650 --> 00:38:01,260
Widowed at a young age,
she refused to remarry,

786
00:38:01,380 --> 00:38:02,690
so she became a Taoist priestess
instead.

787
00:38:03,210 --> 00:38:05,940
I hear she keeps over a dozen
male favorites at her residence.

788
00:38:07,010 --> 00:38:09,090
If a favorite or servant says
one wrong word,

789
00:38:09,530 --> 00:38:10,570
they're often beaten to death
on the spot.

790
00:38:11,130 --> 00:38:13,460
Sheng'an is crawling
with powerful nobles,

791
00:38:13,980 --> 00:38:15,900
but she's the most tyrannical
of them all.

792
00:38:16,380 --> 00:38:18,010
Speaking of the most powerful person
in Sheng'an,

793
00:38:18,650 --> 00:38:19,690
wouldn't that be Lord Yu?

794
00:38:21,780 --> 00:38:23,210
Very perceptive of you.

795
00:38:24,940 --> 00:38:26,820
The Grand Princess can behave
so outrageously

796
00:38:27,490 --> 00:38:28,650
not because she belongs
to the Mu royal family.

797
00:38:29,820 --> 00:38:32,570
I hear she's known Lord Yu for decades,

798
00:38:33,010 --> 00:38:33,820
and they're very close.

799
00:38:34,380 --> 00:38:35,820
That's why she can throw her weight
around in Sheng'an

800
00:38:36,460 --> 00:38:37,130
- without fear of consequences.
- (Behave yourself!)

801
00:38:37,940 --> 00:38:38,420
(I'm talking to you!)

802
00:38:45,860 --> 00:38:47,260
What kind of incense are they burning
in that carriage?

803
00:38:47,780 --> 00:38:48,820
The smell is so overpowering.

804
00:38:50,210 --> 00:38:51,780
Wei Shu, you clearly don't know
the good stuff!

805
00:38:51,860 --> 00:38:53,980
That's incense specially made
for the Grand Princess.

806
00:38:54,050 --> 00:38:55,050
You won't find it anywhere else.

807
00:38:59,740 --> 00:39:00,900
(The Grand Princess's procession
is approaching!)

808
00:39:01,260 --> 00:39:02,340
(Carriages ahead, fall back!)

809
00:39:05,780 --> 00:39:06,380
(Get out of the way!)

810
00:39:07,460 --> 00:39:08,610
(Isn't that Princess
Danyang's carriage?)

811
00:39:09,260 --> 00:39:09,900
(Let's go have a look!)

812
00:39:11,490 --> 00:39:12,460
(How dare you come any closer!)

813
00:39:12,860 --> 00:39:13,260
(Move!)

814
00:39:13,860 --> 00:39:14,610
(You got a death wish?)

815
00:39:15,570 --> 00:39:16,490
(Can't you speak properly?)

816
00:39:16,860 --> 00:39:17,300
(How dare you!)

817
00:39:17,820 --> 00:39:18,420
(Get out of my way!)

818
00:39:19,170 --> 00:39:20,780
(Did you hear me? Move!)

819
00:39:25,340 --> 00:39:25,820
Aunt.

820
00:39:26,460 --> 00:39:27,380
It's been a long time.

821
00:39:41,650 --> 00:39:42,460
Danyang.

822
00:39:43,050 --> 00:39:44,010
My respects, Aunt.

823
00:39:47,100 --> 00:39:49,020
(Mu Ningshuang, Grand Princess Luling)

824
00:39:52,740 --> 00:39:53,210
Fall back.

825
00:39:53,820 --> 00:39:54,690
Let my aunt go first.

826
00:39:55,210 --> 00:39:56,780
(You heard her! Move back!)

827
00:39:57,420 --> 00:39:58,050
(Don't block the way!)

828
00:39:58,650 --> 00:39:59,210
(Don't block the way!)

829
00:40:00,050 --> 00:40:00,530
(Move!)

830
00:40:00,900 --> 00:40:01,340
(Move!)

831
00:40:01,900 --> 00:40:02,380
(Hurry up!)

832
00:40:12,090 --> 00:40:12,460
(Move!)

833
00:40:13,170 --> 00:40:13,570
(Move!)

834
00:40:13,780 --> 00:40:14,900
(Move aside! Fall back!)

835
00:40:15,690 --> 00:40:16,010
(Back!)

836
00:40:16,210 --> 00:40:16,570
(Back!)

837
00:40:16,980 --> 00:40:17,300
(Back!)

838
00:40:27,090 --> 00:40:28,130
Safe travels, Aunt.

839
00:40:45,020 --> 00:40:49,960
♪Let me be the fireflies dancing
across your brow♪

840
00:40:52,310 --> 00:40:57,120
♪Let me hold you
whenever the rain falls♪

841
00:40:57,700 --> 00:41:00,060
♪Together we'll soar to the skies♪

842
00:41:01,460 --> 00:41:01,900
Your Highness.

843
00:41:02,050 --> 00:41:03,550
♪Burning bright as a song♪

844
00:41:05,380 --> 00:41:05,740
Your Highness.

845
00:41:07,620 --> 00:41:12,130
♪Be the promise I hold deep in my heart♪

846
00:41:14,010 --> 00:41:14,490
Shu.

847
00:41:15,900 --> 00:41:17,930
Did your enrollment go smoothly?

848
00:41:17,980 --> 00:41:19,590
♪Not a single hour less♪

849
00:41:20,570 --> 00:41:21,170
Yes, Your Highness.

850
00:41:21,980 --> 00:41:23,780
I enrolled at the Imperial Academy
today.

851
00:41:26,940 --> 00:41:29,130
Did anyone give you trouble there?

852
00:41:30,380 --> 00:41:30,820
No.

853
00:41:31,690 --> 00:41:33,050
In fact, I made two new friends.

854
00:41:34,010 --> 00:41:34,780
This is Feng...

855
00:41:37,260 --> 00:41:38,610
This isn't the place to talk.

856
00:41:39,090 --> 00:41:40,860
Come see me at my residence tonight.

857
00:41:41,390 --> 00:41:43,150
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock in dusk♪

858
00:41:43,200 --> 00:41:43,830
♪May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, and seasons turn♪

859
00:41:44,740 --> 00:41:45,090
Let's go.

860
00:41:46,160 --> 00:41:48,310
♪You're the only one I need♪

861
00:41:48,640 --> 00:41:55,630
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

862
00:41:55,780 --> 00:41:57,600
♪Be my one and only in this world♪

863
00:41:58,000 --> 00:41:58,950
♪Be my one and only in this life♪

864
00:41:59,500 --> 00:42:01,560
♪My last untouched innocence♪

865
00:42:02,570 --> 00:42:03,130
Yan Shang.

866
00:42:03,490 --> 00:42:05,900
Why did the princess seem
to ignore you just now?

867
00:42:13,530 --> 00:42:14,610
Wei Shu. Yan Shang.

868
00:42:14,980 --> 00:42:16,860
You both know Princess Danyang?

869
00:42:36,650 --> 00:42:37,050
What's wrong?

870
00:42:37,940 --> 00:42:38,460
Yan Shang,

871
00:42:39,420 --> 00:42:41,780
the princess asked me to visit
her residence tonight.

872
00:42:42,340 --> 00:42:43,380
Was she serious,

873
00:42:43,820 --> 00:42:44,820
or was she just teasing me?

874
00:42:45,610 --> 00:42:46,740
Whether she was joking or not,

875
00:42:47,420 --> 00:42:48,050
you should go.

876
00:42:50,940 --> 00:42:52,300
Matters of the heart

877
00:42:53,170 --> 00:42:55,460
really are more complicated
than alchemy.

878
00:42:57,610 --> 00:42:58,010
(Hey, you over there!)

879
00:42:58,530 --> 00:42:59,900
(We're one player short for foot polo!)

880
00:43:00,170 --> 00:43:00,530
(Want to join?)

881
00:43:01,940 --> 00:43:02,900
We'll pass.

882
00:43:03,300 --> 00:43:04,340
I don't know how to play anyway.

883
00:43:04,860 --> 00:43:05,570
Neither do I.

884
00:43:10,050 --> 00:43:11,010
I've never played foot polo.

885
00:43:11,490 --> 00:43:12,090
Can I still join?

886
00:43:12,650 --> 00:43:13,140
Of course!

887
00:43:13,190 --> 00:43:13,620
(We can teach you!)

888
00:43:13,670 --> 00:43:14,530
(Sure! No problem!)

889
00:43:14,650 --> 00:43:15,020
(Come on! Let's go!)

890
00:43:15,070 --> 00:43:15,710
(We'll teach you! Come on!)

891
00:43:15,760 --> 00:43:16,060
(Let's go!)

892
00:43:16,110 --> 00:43:17,120
(Just come along!)

893
00:43:17,170 --> 00:43:17,530
(Come on!)

894
00:43:20,130 --> 00:43:21,420
Yan Shang is so easygoing.

895
00:43:22,610 --> 00:43:23,460
Someone like him

896
00:43:24,300 --> 00:43:25,610
must be well-liked by everyone.

897
00:43:27,530 --> 00:43:28,780
Wei Shu, may I have a word in private?

898
00:43:32,860 --> 00:43:34,340
I have a rather presumptuous favor

899
00:43:34,690 --> 00:43:35,780
to ask of you.

900
00:43:36,090 --> 00:43:37,130
Go ahead.

901
00:43:42,210 --> 00:43:44,130
Could you introduce me
to Princess Danyang?

902
00:43:49,980 --> 00:43:50,910
(Imperial Academy)
(What a magnificent carriage!)

903
00:43:50,960 --> 00:43:51,820
(And look at those horses!)

904
00:43:52,170 --> 00:43:53,300
(They're so strong and magnificent!)

905
00:43:53,530 --> 00:43:54,570
(I feel like I've seen them
somewhere before.)

906
00:43:55,650 --> 00:43:56,940
(Isn't that the princess's carriage?)

907
00:43:57,090 --> 00:43:57,570
(That's right!)

908
00:43:58,530 --> 00:43:59,610
(Who's it here to pick up?)

909
00:43:59,780 --> 00:44:00,690
(Don't you recognize
that carriage roof?)

910
00:44:00,860 --> 00:44:01,490
(No idea!)

911
00:44:01,690 --> 00:44:02,260
(No way!)

912
00:44:02,690 --> 00:44:03,750
(Princess Danyang's carriage?)

913
00:44:03,800 --> 00:44:04,730
(Why is it parked outside our door?)

914
00:44:04,780 --> 00:44:05,140
(Exactly!)

915
00:44:05,190 --> 00:44:06,020
(It looks like an empress's carriage!)

916
00:44:06,070 --> 00:44:06,950
(Could it be here to pick up...)

917
00:44:07,000 --> 00:44:07,350
(Possibly!)

918
00:44:07,400 --> 00:44:08,130
(It really is the princess!)

919
00:44:08,300 --> 00:44:08,950
(How could that be?)

920
00:44:09,000 --> 00:44:09,500
(Don't talk nonsense!)

921
00:44:09,550 --> 00:44:10,490
(The princess's carriage is here
in person!)

922
00:44:10,650 --> 00:44:11,500
- Excuse me.
- (The princess's carriage...)

923
00:44:11,550 --> 00:44:12,460
(Why would it pick up one of us?)

924
00:44:12,690 --> 00:44:13,210
Sir.

925
00:44:13,610 --> 00:44:13,940
This way, please.

926
00:44:14,090 --> 00:44:15,380
(Could it be here for him?)

927
00:44:16,130 --> 00:44:16,980
- (Nonsense!)
- (Why is he getting in?)

928
00:44:17,380 --> 00:44:18,170
(I'd already heard about it!)

929
00:44:18,740 --> 00:44:20,170
(Wei Shu has close ties
to the princess's residence.)

930
00:44:21,980 --> 00:44:22,690
(So the rumors are true!)

931
00:44:23,190 --> 00:44:23,540
(Oh, my!)

932
00:44:23,590 --> 00:44:24,610
(I'd already heard about it.)

933
00:44:25,050 --> 00:44:26,260
(He's Princess Danyang's...)

934
00:44:26,570 --> 00:44:27,460
(It's true! It really is!)

935
00:44:28,240 --> 00:44:28,540
(Oh, dear!)

936
00:44:28,590 --> 00:44:29,940
(That's no way for a scholar
to get ahead!)

937
00:44:40,580 --> 00:44:44,580
(Next Episode Preview)

938
00:44:46,420 --> 00:44:47,420
Yan Shang, come on! Hurry!

939
00:44:51,090 --> 00:44:51,860
I'll make a sacrifice

940
00:44:53,650 --> 00:44:54,170
and marry you.

941
00:44:54,420 --> 00:44:55,820
Your Highness, look who's here!

942
00:45:01,360 --> 00:45:04,653
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

943
00:45:07,338 --> 00:45:12,254
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

944
00:45:14,448 --> 00:45:20,293
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

945
00:45:20,793 --> 00:45:26,019
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

946
00:45:28,788 --> 00:45:33,579
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

947
00:45:34,415 --> 00:45:40,494
♪Through trails of mud and blood;
let grief drown in your eyes♪

948
00:45:42,295 --> 00:45:45,445
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

949
00:45:45,445 --> 00:45:47,093
♪Burning bright as a song♪

950
00:45:47,145 --> 00:45:50,869
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

951
00:45:51,247 --> 00:45:55,913
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

952
00:45:56,532 --> 00:46:00,573
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

953
00:46:01,064 --> 00:46:03,179
♪Not a single hour less♪

954
00:46:03,219 --> 00:46:10,165
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

955
00:46:10,928 --> 00:46:14,381
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

956
00:46:14,561 --> 00:46:17,706
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

957
00:46:18,145 --> 00:46:24,782
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

958
00:46:25,179 --> 00:46:29,693
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

959
00:46:29,731 --> 00:46:32,200
♪You're the only one I need♪

960
00:46:32,404 --> 00:46:39,291
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

961
00:46:39,603 --> 00:46:42,874
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

962
00:46:43,179 --> 00:46:46,352
♪My last untouched innocence♪

963
00:46:46,676 --> 00:46:50,102
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

964
00:46:50,335 --> 00:46:53,560
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

965
00:46:53,891 --> 00:47:00,687
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

966
00:47:01,056 --> 00:47:05,622
♪May time be free of fear and pain;
boats rock, lights fade, seasons turn♪

967
00:47:05,669 --> 00:47:08,007
♪You're the only one I need♪

968
00:47:08,238 --> 00:47:15,073
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

969
00:47:15,422 --> 00:47:17,040
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

970
00:47:17,170 --> 00:47:18,966
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

971
00:47:19,323 --> 00:47:22,340
♪You're the only one I need♪

972
00:47:22,380 --> 00:47:23,707
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
